{"id": "70697", "title": "富贵锦绣", "author": "飞翼", "category": "都市言情", "count": 69, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70697/70697s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/70/70697.htm", "intro": "虽然做了丫鬟\n    可是作为英国公夫人的大丫鬟\n    荣华富贵，锦衣美食还有主子的青睐\n    锦绣当真如同副小姐一般地长大\n    绫罗堆儿里十几年\n    富贵享了\n    嫁妆丰厚\n    还是挑一个忠犬相公\n    继续开开心心地过日子罢\n    这是一个好命的大丫鬟自幼没吃苦没受累没受委屈地在公爵府过日子顺便攒嫁妆置产业的故事，本文虽然附带公爵府宅斗生活，但是种田文，虽然有些金手指，但是想看这丫鬟和皇帝王爷世子什么的虐恋情深，改变世界什么的，这里绝对没有谢谢~~这女主嫁不到这样的人家儿~\n    本文不虐女主，男主忠犬，不喜勿入\n    另：此作者初次尝试古言，心理脆弱，谢绝各种拍砖扒榜谢谢各位亲的体谅~", "base": "files/article/html/70/70697", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第2章", "file": "11086732.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "11086733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章", "file": "11086734.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "11086735.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "11086736.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "11086737.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "11086738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章", "file": "11086739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第26章", "file": "11086740.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第29章", "file": "11086741.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第32章", "file": "11086742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第35章", "file": "11086743.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第38章", "file": "11086744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第41章", "file": "11086745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第44章", "file": "11086746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第47章", "file": "11086747.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第50章", "file": "11086748.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第53章", "file": "11086749.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第56章", "file": "11086750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第59章", "file": "11086751.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第62章", "file": "11086752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第65章", "file"